    "title": "Sledge and Order",
    "teaser": "A missing informant, a mob-run diner, and a walk-in freezer running colder than the truth.",
    "cover_appearance": "retro neon diner at night, rain-slicked asphalt, fedora shadow, cold blue freezer mist, noir mood",
