      "text_log_content": "HASH-HOUSE SLANG GLOSSARY:\n- 'Adam & Eve on a Raft': Two Poached Eggs on Toast\n- 'Wreck 'em': Scrambled Eggs\n- 'Bowl of Red': Chili con Carne\n- 'Slab of Moo': Ribeye Steak\n- 'Put out the lights and cry': Liver and Onions",
      "text_log_format": "BOOK",
      "on_read_script": "tw.vars.set('slang_learned', True)\ntw.story.show_message('You now know the diner slang: Adam & Eve on a Raft means Two Poached Eggs on Toast!')"
    },
